cident INC-0001 for checkout-api, and on-call has been paged. The summary covers the failed v2.3.1 release, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-up work. The first incident request timed out, so I retried with an idempotency key. The retry returned one incident, INC-0001, so no duplicate was created.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator partial failure before re-attempting v2.3.1.", "type": "text"}]}]}